L69: Ethics statement
L70: The studies involving human participants were reviewed and approved by the Chinese Clinical Trial System (registration number: ChiCTR1800015383). The patients/participants provided their written informed consent to participate in this study. Written informed consent was obtained from the individual(s) for the publication of any potentially identifiable images or data included in this article.
